# Minecraft 3D Viewer — Project Context

## Tech Stack
- **3D:** Three.js
- **Language:** TypeScript
- **Build:** Vite
- **Skins:** 64×64 PNG, standard Minecraft layout
- **Animations:** Mixamo FBX, RunningboyRig

## Key Files

| File | Purpose |
|------|---------|
| `src/main.ts` | Entry point: orchestration, model load, skin/anim logic, API events |
| `src/styles/` | SCSS partials: reset, routes, creator/*, viewer-controls, fake-chat |
| `src/viewer/` | Scene setup, skin application, orbit/pointer controls |
| `src/creator.ts` | Character creator (2D/3D skin editor) |
| `src/skin/` | Skin layout, coordinates, preprocessing, mesh→part mapping (single source of truth) |
| `docs/concepts/TAXONOMY.md` | Source structure: domain, lib, config, state, services, controllers, ui |
| `docs/minecraft-skin-layout-specification.md` | Skin layout, region bounds, UVs |
| `server/api.js` | API handlers: `/api/skin`, `/api/animation`, `/api/events` |

## Doc Reference

- **App modes (home / creator / Creator.2D…):** `docs/concepts/MODES.md`
- **Plans/specs:** `PLAN-GUIDE.md`
- **Skin/UV:** `docs/minecraft-skin-layout-specification.md`
- **Skin artist/agent:** `docs/MINECRAFT-SKIN-ARTIST-AND-AGENT-SPEC.md` (pixel bounds, color theory, patterns, ImageMagick)
- **Creator:** `docs/CHARACTER-CREATION-SCREEN-SPEC.md`
- **Debugging:** `docs/TROUBLESHOOTING.md`

## Conventions

- Use `SKIN_LAYER_BOUNDS` or `MINECRAFT_SKIN_UVS` for skin regions (import from `src/skin`)
- FBX scale: `model.scale.setScalar(0.01)`
- Mesh→skin mapping: `getMinecraftPartFromMeshName()` in `src/skin`

## Dev Environment

- **Mac:** MacBook Pro 13-inch, M1, 2020, 16GB RAM, macOS Tahoe 26.2
- **Shell:** Zsh (default when Cursor runs terminal commands on macOS)

## Release Environment

- Multi-platform Electron application (Windows, Mac, and Linux)
